    "remedy_2": {
      "id": "remedy_2",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let's check this one.\n\nThe equality is not true for every pair; it is the equality case of the two means.\n\nThe condition becomes √(xy)=(x+y)/2, which forces (x−y)²=0, so x=y.\n\nNow use the same idea with fresh values.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
